{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-25T22:18:42.966Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the watcher's focused scenario-test gate for change 082 task 3.\n\n**Code**\n- `src/harness/types.ts` — added the `focused_ran` event type, `FocusedRanOutcome`, and `FocusedRanEventData`, wired into `OsqEventData`.\n- `src/watcher/focused-verify.ts` (new) — `checkFocusedTests` collects via `collectFocusedTests`, runs via `runFocusedTests`, appends the typed event, and on `failed` kills through `fail` with the specified `verify_red` marker (`focused: true`, quoted command, `Watcher focused scenario tests failed:` body). `problem`/`passed` defer to verify.\n- `src/watcher/task-verify.ts` — `checkBlockedFirst` calls it last, after `checkMissingVerifyPaths`. `runner.ts` untouched.\n- `tests/focused-verify.test.ts` (new) — 7 tests: pass→verify ordering, failing scenario ends the attempt with no `verify_ran`, broken command → `problem`, unset command → no event, automatic retry carrying the focused output, plus two real TAP runs of the copied pricing fixture (intact passes; `>= 100`→`> 100` ends on the focused run).\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify: `node --import tsx --test tests/focused-verify.test.ts` — 7/7 pass.\n- Proposal verify: `pnpm verify` — exit 0 (2071 CLI tests, 88 UI tests, lint clean).\n\n**Notable deviation** (documented in the result file): the copied pricing fixture's helper import is rewritten to the absolute URL per the task, but a comment preserves the literal `from '@matteeh/osq/testing'`, because the scenario index scanner keys on that literal — otherwise collection would be empty and no focused run would occur.\n\nTouched: `src/harness/types.ts`, `src/watcher/task-verify.ts`, `src/watcher/focused-verify.ts`, `tests/focused-verify.test.ts`."}}
